  "structure": {
    "block_count": 108,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "What Are Some Fun Food Ideas for a Gender Reveal Party?",
        "text_sha256": "0e5f0e11789746336995ea3f0ebaddd2e3d8a0d38d5e1a748df6d8461bc7d687",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, information, sources, and formatting",
        "text_sha256": "5984bfc461752e98ecb6d4bd49ba063c8b8b48c66d58971fcc05fc9b26fbdb53",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal food ideas, ice cream cone with sprinkles",
        "text_sha256": "bc3b39acfa102c64a0446f6e97de0a7128bc9f128dec9593c21902b88f0b6958",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "From pink-and-blue treats to pregnancy-safe snacks and fun reveal desserts, here are some food ideas to make your gender reveal party memorable.",
        "text_sha256": "cf906652a87273e7a037ccbe64c12ca837fa9b93e0fc2965cbafc78c99791c06",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A gender reveal party is a great opportunity to have some fun with food. Create a menu that matches your gender reveal theme , or stick with a classic pink-and-blue palette. Think foods that are naturally pink or blue (like strawberries or blueberries) and foods you can customize (with pink or blue icing or sprinkles, for example).",
        "text_sha256": "465de3d8cc7c8890b63e882a6cbeac851b6be6c1443c9e171248610d0e2291cb",
        "word_count": 57
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This is such an exciting time for you and your loved ones, so make sure their stomachs are as full as their hearts. Read on for ideas for gender reveal drinks, desserts, and more.",
        "text_sha256": "66439258edd5327654ddfc6ce8a246b9e6b74d31c9af902c8e8e00c21f456c87",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Stick to a fun, themed menu — especially pink and blue options. Gender reveal foods often follow a pink-and-blue color scheme, with customizable treats like cupcakes, cookies, cake pops, and drinks that match the theme or reveal the baby’s sex.",
        "text_sha256": "58aaef3375f333698a09853527db65522947dd5c2350a8e0303ac01c9c742df9",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Offer a mix of sweet treats, light bites, and drinks. A well-rounded menu includes desserts, finger foods, and themed drinks or mocktails to keep guests satisfied.",
        "text_sha256": "f7e31abf6524c872de807b884efb270ab1c818a5173f117b22460dcda23dcef9",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Prioritize pregnancy-safe and guest-friendly foods. Make sure the menu includes foods that are safe for the mom-to-be while still appealing to guests, keeping the event enjoyable and inclusive for everyone.",
        "text_sha256": "cd177411eb18595a53a6ddce969b8540ff97382eafbb1527c0dd8d826b9b0ba4",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What foods should I serve at our gender reveal?",
        "text_sha256": "97595b848f899942624259f54c9d1d6d29449608f05bb4a4b07a2f649941424f",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "In many ways, this is your day. Plan a menu that everyone will enjoy — including pregnancy-safe foods for you and your baby. That means skipping items like cheese boards, sushi, and deli meats (save those for baby's first birthday bash).",
        "text_sha256": "4666eb62c033ff5658c6e9afc335e4082406d5796261f4500d20eab2d4e5c5f8",
        "word_count": 41
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What are some blue and pink food ideas?",
        "text_sha256": "d8cd4f8b6b9f222832aa5dc965f085cc8da129acffa03b75da2843f8b00050a2",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "These classic colors offer plenty of inspiration for your menu. Choose food that are blue or pink, or customize any party foods with colors. Here are some ideas:",
        "text_sha256": "c9d5622b1bbffe03cb5664a96fb5d321ddbc9ba3699d42cfb347570ac0a7ee08",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Blue and pink cookies",
        "text_sha256": "0171e00b267fc0de637f621448394f072972fd024645db0865c3e6fd24c41d05",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal onesie cookies",
        "text_sha256": "4b8e8a9472cc06800f1696c2064582626979146b23e96fb30c19516c0ca32851",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Complete with a family name, these cookies are outfitted with a onesie design and serve as an adorable addition to any gender reveal party.",
        "text_sha256": "0f2da759beee987cba05fff1f42c1b465b95d563af09c928ca77cd3244baf646",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"It was fun to see some people walk around with all blue or pink plates sticking to what gender they thought it was,\" says What to Expect Community mom elizabethh01.",
        "text_sha256": "bd1e92f655e2e1a618dcc2e40fb547c4b0efb07f82a09cf655c029c6ba73e642",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Berries",
        "text_sha256": "d4b33a2e35eb8b5cfdbbc851299d03a0007afb1b26aa324019204dda24cda778",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For a lighter option, serve strawberries or raspberries for pink and blueberries for blue.",
        "text_sha256": "7ae0d23b53fb346a04b6f58e74e90e4077ecc4ecbd33b536e7bcefa3650b6b6a",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Rice Krispies pops",
        "text_sha256": "142b55483598836c0ec96f3e06d7eeac11bdbc858931dc63f661cb5dfa8fe63e",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal rice krispies pops",
        "text_sha256": "696e75050b39c08c3caff8a97f5bb7ca886ef8dd1164db8034c2e2de1a16e299",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "These chocolate-covered crisped rice treats, decorated with baby footprints, are an oh-so-sweet (and gluten-free) item to serve your guests.",
        "text_sha256": "4e45ec53d3e1457533db22b7ff4dd1dca361927e0aa86b606b3e3c0c0f9452ca",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Personalized M&M's",
        "text_sha256": "d0cb90c4f69217a545129e1393a17b134aeca4b5db19b98d6f4180b53e3b93ef",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Custom-order M&M's in pink, blue, or a mix, and add a personalized message for décor and dessert in one.",
        "text_sha256": "6d7d46f7baa1835f33c7666b469b7d131c928c56b8ecda09d6453e40341dfccb",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Smash boxes",
        "text_sha256": "7c4e467a2a43599c12ccc864e499d8e4d6fc0f8d241529fcd929c609c931dd1b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal smash boxes",
        "text_sha256": "94ec0414279b3427ea533622ad08ac1f4f1667864122cb5311cdffa7d479ef96",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For a dramatic reveal, smash a chocolate box filled with blue or pink candies.",
        "text_sha256": "9711a44d920cc0788615f77b68251b00e31162642ccae6d171a7f0b2ece68a6a",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Cheesecake cups",
        "text_sha256": "9b81b24a40d5f251cf7f698da1c250c1bc1efeb106420c86ca39ce6a1be7e679",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal cheesecake cups",
        "text_sha256": "6bb69ce137f96ba0ec271e2472ca9e2ecd6d09b15bccc6c7cc47bcb4da79b796",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "These individually prepared blue and pink cheesecake cups come adorned with gold pacifiers, teddy bears, and tiny footprints.",
        "text_sha256": "02891ab9ffa0e6f76d5f04ef83ace87765a9dd6a395da5dd767fe6900faf52f9",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Cake pops",
        "text_sha256": "d7ac618bad7c3699a1743b5233cb20773e68e6568351f5ebca4f272c4358151c",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Put a twist on the classic gender reveal cake by handing out cake pops. Bonus: You can even turn it into a game by revealing baby's sex in just one of the cake pops. Go around the room and have each guest bite into theirs. It's a little suspenseful and super fun!",
        "text_sha256": "61b6406d49f171e66def6095060b80a61b04bf87ba0611ceac6e7cf40f6b2fb2",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Cupcakes",
        "text_sha256": "31b97c27f41a60b8f12f76ef13f3e3645b4c3671c326a45d455acba88c8d0af8",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Top your gender reveal cupcakes with pink and blue frosting, or have a surprise filling waiting on the inside.",
        "text_sha256": "750130342f3083558eeb78b29ec5820bf27b33c3ae62790c30f691e340057f08",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Themed cookies",
        "text_sha256": "732be9e7ce224f2e1224083d593706bf9969322fd363f0b8a9663b877ec8d222",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal cookies",
        "text_sha256": "d048e28d1a61ed71cce5c972f21accc006ed9b4110c54e850877c8dc61ca97cc",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Go long! A football-themed party can stay sweet thanks to these cookies featuring footballs and blue and pink jerseys.",
        "text_sha256": "aded6260c14e6f8d3d873cd3af617142c5a7aaf164f35c0ad0dce27870afa229",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Hot chocolate bar",
        "text_sha256": "038ee2d94914f6e379b8f67e02deecd1535efe40d1e42daaa72a5ecd5a25b801",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal hot chocolate bar",
        "text_sha256": "979bd6c77cb5b2422061c8e02baeb173b31506e72194db45aaf7c0f38614ce25",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Hosting a gender reveal party in the winter? Heat up some hot chocolate and offer a tray full of pink and blue toppings.",
        "text_sha256": "649b82a043ecf507a135525d75e13aa9af441caa0029bf10400904cba209dbb4",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Chocolate-covered pretzel sticks",
        "text_sha256": "63cbe11dd302ffba14350db992adb50e5ce361aee40914874444552c87d1fb34",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal pretzel sticks",
        "text_sha256": "04d573ab47a17487a6a5337965ef9f0ae0afc4303b7d2e82fc5565817dded469",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A beloved savory-meets-sweet treat, these dipped pretzel sticks are an ideal finger food to munch on during your celebration.",
        "text_sha256": "ff8a7ab094138d26edae1b2cf65a73caacf75c10813fa2413dcfbf5fdbabef1e",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Want to keep track of every milestone — from the big reveal to baby’s first birthday? The What to Expect app helps you log the little (and big!) celebrations along the way.",
        "text_sha256": "b8bea952001723272eeaad13475a5be2118783ee0a833bc9cb71ae2e934efb7b",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What are some other gender reveal food ideas?",
        "text_sha256": "23e21a534df539645c18989a13e9a795e1508ba140076120faa4b02175fdfddd",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Not all your food needs to be color themed, of course. Turn to your favorite party foods, cravings, or ways to celebrate — do you prefer a brunch or a picnic, for example?",
        "text_sha256": "cd745ea6f29e08d0061e3a440c5b2cfde2268485f0711927127d58fe12b3c406",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Community mom maverick1110 did a \"baby-q\" on July 3 for their reveal party, where they served BBQ foods and picnic-style sides, along with pink and blue cookies and punch.",
        "text_sha256": "20309057759a37d43bf486f509b47bde71d96dd305c22d54d9ca2b3af7422505",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Community member hannahmccuiston1234 says, \"We did a simple brunch! I made pancakes that were pink and blue and just had eggs and bacon... It was really simple and stress free but very enjoyable!\"",
        "text_sha256": "d0c91b0bc5d08b31213e00aba4a2b00a724947be5a981e4635488369c361fc00",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here are some ideas for rounding out your party menu:",
        "text_sha256": "6040a90039dee5ff559c7033092fbd6aad0466c07db9e4130227d131f2a1144e",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000050",
        "block_index": 50,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Pickles",
        "text_sha256": "ebec0b6a6a91e47c02837ec88a388b4ea57512a609d05a7646c544d6bddb8d9a",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000051",
        "block_index": 51,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Is your number one pregancy craving a big ol' dill spear? Share your favorite snack by offering pickles on a stick or a large platter of cukes. Add even more color to your party with other fresh veggies, too.",
        "text_sha256": "aa21262f96c68844f10ed44caa095411f8b5b8c10b03a65de6d1fc9094a87a53",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000052",
        "block_index": 52,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Yogurt parfaits",
        "text_sha256": "1c8b7af57139eea0fe43b03fe40d12a6f5ba288b60dfb5b1071d274a06055730",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000053",
        "block_index": 53,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Guests will appreciate a healthful cup full of yogurt, fruit, and granola. This is a great option for a brunch-style celebration.",
        "text_sha256": "473bab54dd97432ef170cc8e876ccf66f7d8ac563ff5bf76e43270fa43f1f5e0",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000054",
        "block_index": 54,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Popcorn cones",
        "text_sha256": "70a623d2dfc878f35f3d476fedacc252849054d5fce9a748eb3fb84a630d9dc2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000055",
        "block_index": 55,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal popcorn cones",
        "text_sha256": "b7f9cf49c53d4d476f1e3510335cc2394c3c3c658806af08ecc6feccd06ee57a",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000056",
        "block_index": 56,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Filled with sweet kettle corn or salty kernels, pre-portioned cones make popcorn the cutest party snack. You can decorate the paper cups with a little message, too.",
        "text_sha256": "d9072a04b278ad58ffbf4389ff9ee6256fc4ecccae6f49937eaa792f10815024",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000057",
        "block_index": 57,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Salad",
        "text_sha256": "e209d05dba2181f66163d6e712abf2c16ec46607394bacf829f498adda336601",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000058",
        "block_index": 58,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Hosting a light lunch or picnic-style gathering? Offer up some greens mixed with beans or chicken, your favorite vegetables, avocado, and a simple dressing.",
        "text_sha256": "534a964586f62a2c416d7471210530955f7e410a98f12a834594334673d37a0f",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000059",
        "block_index": 59,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Grazing boards",
        "text_sha256": "bf3ae72c48985bb6f2d905940529d934a639b7740b4c7b32ebe4caa10f11efc4",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000060",
        "block_index": 60,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Arrange all of your favorite bites together on a beautiful board. Think: dried fruits, veggie spears, nuts, pretzels, grapes, and other pregnancy-safe snacks .",
        "text_sha256": "51f1b0df9dfb00ded84cb0a4f72b04f81266ed638762650ed71d67f027e99b47",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Ice cream",
        "text_sha256": "8068467fef130f5c3d66fb9cdfab92b5c21912a7f61ae583981329fde2ac2602",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Another classic pregnancy craving, ice cream will thrill both kids and adults. Offer bowls of pink and blue candy to use as themed toppings.",
        "text_sha256": "2cab2a6aeb0508199321f0c6303f43f4262e164cfd24ec99a84eb5294555f6da",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"We had an ice cream themed party with a build-your-own sundae bar. It was so fun!\" says Community mom Mearna.",
        "text_sha256": "fe63c747a79f90f737850eb22df821672de102d649dd26a95766f64648169e9b",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What drinks can I serve at our gender reveal?",
        "text_sha256": "147c83b170f85ad05cb9720f2dc26cebc3adf44b72415afdb2ea2d039caf9a7d",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Guests will appreciate fun beverages, so don’t forget to give drinks some thought when you’re planning your party. As with foods, drinks can be color appropriate or party themed — or just a favorite way to make a toast.",
        "text_sha256": "5b27fa0c62173c750295ca902c8329614e3afad82bd20477f9deaedb48e3d581",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here are just a few ideas for keeping guests refreshed:",
        "text_sha256": "0318bbe1b9a15fe4cf368fab19b560bf6aa01aca7ee83dc09f7b84e0ca5829cd",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Blue and pink punch",
        "text_sha256": "b61bfb270df5fd4e4d836501355cc0b29bd14da0af4d41a95ac6701ab1f769bb",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "gender reveal punch",
        "text_sha256": "5f964b7b525520a7913e9c28cf5f576d5fafd35a7ed8aa6a676189257e859b05",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pre-pour beverages accessorized with pink and blue sugar-rimmed glasses.",
        "text_sha256": "1c2ff2bb179f8658759c2b6b99d4152a9db67b643b44aa799dcde716840de132",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000070",
        "block_index": 70,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Mom-osa",
        "text_sha256": "12b420e7a9a8692b36f242e29b3f4943a6c6f72b115b724b830aed517a1684bd",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000071",
        "block_index": 71,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Offer a mocktail with juice and soda for the guest of honor, plus additional bubbly for others.",
        "text_sha256": "d60437773aae1eaeb71ba6415d79a49d8326eb4e1cb63f10dd2deb405fc12e12",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000072",
        "block_index": 72,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Fruit and veggie smoothies",
        "text_sha256": "dfb07c174e0469b354b8208a0c8a7622f50e9340449dcddc868f8d4d2dd99f9d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000073",
        "block_index": 73,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Smoothies work well for daytime gatherings. Depending on the fruits and vegetables you use, you can also make your signature blend look blue or pink.",
        "text_sha256": "7aa06dc37884f891dee29b58d716a1bd38a55cea798b3af48350881234a8cce7",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000074",
        "block_index": 74,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your gender reveal party is a time to celebrate and prepare for your baby's arrival. By sweetening the deal with delectable snacks and treats, you and your guests can feel satisfied in every way. Cheers to you and your little boy or girl!",
        "text_sha256": "dab645adb01aad77e0ee15719099ce59c11980f119a701ae8e0d5bc1efc3e00b",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000075",
        "block_index": 75,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "FAQ",
        "text_sha256": "dbc468a14b601d5d9240aeb72b9fcd2f8aed2f4e30932876edf8d16ec313846b",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000076",
        "block_index": 76,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Do you serve food at a gender reveal?",
        "text_sha256": "6f6aefcaee04a222ba91ef7f3f90c1332c92bed1bb8c4b3c7988df3e7e456e5a",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000077",
        "block_index": 77,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Yes, most hosts serve snacks and drinks at a gender reveal party. You can even incorporate food into the reveal itself!",
        "text_sha256": "a8e988392c23b7cfec3f330dbca72efad4e31d7182f201ded1ecfae9613c45e3",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000078",
        "block_index": 78,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "What kind of food do you serve at a gender reveal?",
        "text_sha256": "4d522a8d8a9b33f2e7abf8e9cf5cab1e69a5ad261f35800f72ca36ca227ba252",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000079",
        "block_index": 79,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Finger foods work well for gender reveal parties, especially pink and blue treats alongside classic party snacks.",
        "text_sha256": "023ec9002834ef30d579a6147d1277e4cd180f3be3064280dd665a5888187b14",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000080",
        "block_index": 80,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "What pink and blue foods can you serve at a gender reveal party?",
        "text_sha256": "a8a1ed1d8355573a188acf8cf507122a114ca65486494c8ee230434eb3b66630",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000081",
        "block_index": 81,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Customize desserts like cupcakes, cookies, cake pops, and M&M's with your chosen colors for a gender reveal. And you can mix up a custom pink or blue punch for your guests to sip.",
        "text_sha256": "76beb76c9a3c5056f1589052c90ad8ba3da55b34ea72f382b4cd767cb15aeefe",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000082",
        "block_index": 82,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "What desserts work well for a gender reveal?",
        "text_sha256": "2dcd855ad0a7ada6dc46e561abd2c35ee7a0d730d7391c393f64ba32fc1d000a",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000083",
        "block_index": 83,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If your gender reveal menu needs a little something sweet, you have a lot of options. Consider cake, cookies, cupcakes, cake pops, cheesecake bites, chocolate-covered pretzels, cotton candy, or even a hot chocolate or sundae bar for your party.",
        "text_sha256": "75aa0c4d89a7fae02b7a2d28068008ed12b0677bc7fa150584b276df4d487719",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000084",
        "block_index": 84,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "WhatToExpect.com, How to Plan the Ultimate Gender Reveal Party , May 2023. WhatToExpect.com, 10 Gender Reveal Themes to Inspire Your Special Celebration , May 2023. WhatToExpect.com, 30 Gender Reveal Ideas for Celebrating Your Baby , May 2023. WhatToExpect.com, From Sushi to Soft Cheese: What's Off Limits During Pregnancy and Why , March 2026. WhaToExpect.com, How to Plan a First Birthday Party , December 2023. WhatToExpect.com, 14 Gender Reveal Cake Ideas to Share Your Sweet Baby News , May 2023. WhatToExpect.com, How to Make Gender Reveal Cupcakes to Share Your Special News , June 2023. WhatToExpect.com, Managing Pregnancy Cravings and Aversions (From No-Thanks to Need-It-Now) , October 2025. WhatToExpect.com, Best Healthy Pregnancy Snacks to Satisfy Your Cravings , June 2022. WhatToExpect.com, 5 Delicious DIY Pregnancy Mocktails (With Bump-Friendly Benefits! ), October 2025.",
        "text_sha256": "2683d11abdf73edac45f468a5080f1749fa8f451b8ea42d209efa05693603a8b",
        "word_count": 131
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000085",
        "block_index": 85,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Updates history",
        "text_sha256": "8ce5f24a37ab68e01743f0cb3f0234dd767a31a441e3e3be35047619722ffec6",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000086",
        "block_index": 86,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "March 26, 2026",
        "text_sha256": "498f34fcd1510d3ae95687ec5ead58e80841c9a117a9bffdf0e7a72a447d9895",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000087",
        "block_index": 87,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Updates to copy, information, sources, and formatting",
        "text_sha256": "5984bfc461752e98ecb6d4bd49ba063c8b8b48c66d58971fcc05fc9b26fbdb53",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000088",
        "block_index": 88,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Editors: Karen Miles/Rebekah Wahlberg",
        "text_sha256": "c0bd5cd6e8d09c98dcc5d1265ad6fb57ca031c3fb2e717030b6d8f9e58639f59",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000089",
        "block_index": 89,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Jump to Your Week of Pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "92e57241f3a3f3bbb34cc8779211cc4afae4630d42d914f8cb621a8cb210ef95",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
